{# ---- 8. SOURCE ATTRIBUTION ---- #}
## Source Attribution and Audit

**Data sources:** SEC EDGAR XBRL (companyfacts API), yfinance (market prices, peer financials). All data filtered to `source_available_date ≤ {{ report_date }}`. Zero lookahead violations.

**LLM systems:** Claude / Kiro (Anthropic) for implementation and report generation. ChatGPT / OpenAI for audit, critique, and prompt generation. LLM outputs were not treated as sources of truth.

**Prompt-log coverage:** Verbatim prompts where available; reconstructed summaries for earlier workflow prompts. Missing prompts did not serve as factual sources. See `outputs/prompt_log.md`.

**Exhibits:** This report includes 7 active charts (revenue growth, margins, FCF, DCF scenarios, reverse-DCF grid, recommendation scorecard, and peer multiples). Two NLP diagnostic charts (narrative drift and keyword heatmap) appear in the Technical Appendix only — they are below the coverage threshold and excluded from the rating. The automated segment revenue chart is not shown because XBRL label extraction was unreliable; a manual platform revenue table is provided instead.

