| ML revenue model | 4 annual obs.; R² not reported (unstable at this sample size); best-baseline RMSE = 0.65; model underperforms | Feature-to-obs. ratio ~6:1; overfit risk | Cross-company panel (500+ obs.) |
| Best baseline | Mean baseline RMSE = 0.65; last-period RMSE = 0.97 | Used as benchmark only | N/A |
| NLP drift | Coverage = 32.4% vs. 50% threshold | HTML parsing failures on older filings | Form-specific parsing; manual QA |
| Diagnostic composite | Not backtested; descriptive scorecard | Not a predictive model | Backtesting framework |

